# Open 24.1
tags: open, benchmark, 2024
stimulus: 90 dumbbell snatches and 90 burpees; alternate arms by set, not by rep.
note: All snatches of a set are done on the same arm, then the burpees, then the other arm. The burpees are lateral, over the dumbbell.
For time, cap 15:00
21-15-9
  Dumbbell snatch 50/35 lb ("arm 1")
  Burpee ("lateral over the dumbbell")
  Dumbbell snatch 50/35 lb ("arm 2")
  Burpee ("lateral over the dumbbell")

Scaled:
  Dumbbell snatch 35/20 lb
